<https://w3id.org/laad/tesauro/rol/autor-de-fraude> a skos:Concept ; skos:inScheme tes:roles ; skos:broader <https://w3id.org/laad/tesauro/rol/participante-en-hecho> ;
    skos:prefLabel "autor de fraude o robo"@es ;
